<title>SINGAPORE: OCBC CLARIFIES COMPARATIVE EPS DATA.</title>
<headline>OCBC CLARIFIES COMPARATIVE EPS DATA.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oversea-Chinese Banking Corp Ltd (OCBC) said on Tuesday its earnings per share figures published in interim resultslast week had not been adjusted to reflect a one-for-10 rights issue in July.</p>
<p>OCBC said in a statement its earnings per share for the six months to June 30, 1996 should have been Singapore $0.26, not the S$0.28 published in its interim statement.</p>
